<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 5: </span><span id="S4.F5.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Comparison between base models and tuned models using Tool-DC (TB) on Standard ACEBench.
</span>
</figcaption>
